		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010010b"},
		line=2117,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"In the Imperial Year 2142, the Albright Republic commenced its wars of aggression under the banner of “liberating oppressed populaces from tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Faced with the Republic's overwhelming military might, the nations it targeted were subjugated with minimal resistance.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"In less than thirty years of fighting, the Republic extended its dominion over more than half the world.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Toyoashihara no Mizugaki no Uchi no Sumeramikoto no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Also known simply as “the Empire,” a single Imperial Family has reigned over this extraordinary nation since its founding over two thousand years ago.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Though beset from all sides by aggressors throughout its long history, the Empire has always been protected by the magicks of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The people of foreign nations call it “the realm under\nGod's protection” with fearful reverence.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"However, three years ago, in the Imperial Year 2173─",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The Barrier suddenly ceased all functions, and in the blink of an eye, the Empire fell into the Republic's clutches.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The Republican Army was commanded by the governor-general of the Republic, Warren Valentine.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"He remained in the Empire following the war, and currently oversees its military occupation.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Warren adopted a policy of indirect rule in order to govern the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"That is, the Empire's traditional political institutions would be preserved, even as the Republic Government-General dictates all its affairs of state.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"The head of the Imperial state is the newly-enthroned Empress ",
{"ruby", text="Jade"},
"Hisui",
{"/ruby"},
".",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Yet real power is held by the governor-general's loyal subordinate, Chancellor Okonogi Tokihiko.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Okonogi unfalteringly governs in the Republic's sole interests, ruthlessly cracking down on any Imperial citizens who dare to resist.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Freedom of speech and the press have been greatly curtailed, and three years after the war, the flames of rebellion appear all but extinguished.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"However, the embers of resentment still yet smolder beneath the Imperial capital of Tenkyo...",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Morning, eleven of the clock.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The headquarters of the Sworn Blades is enveloped in an oppressive atmosphere.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"The twenty-odd warriors present are uniformly silent.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Her arms crossed, acting chairman of the Sworn Blades Inou Hotori sits in the seat of honor.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Tokita, your report.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"She calls my name.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I stand and lower my gaze to the documents in my hand.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This month, we retrieved eight spellblades from the Republic, of which one is a keenblade.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We suffered nine casualties, three killed and six captured by the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Our spy Ina Koyuzu reported that the captured warriors were summarily executed.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Yet again, the chancellor's reprisals have claimed the lives of my fellow warriors.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Those men who laughed alongside me just the other day.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"I clench my teeth, holding back any outward display of my frustration.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Hotori silently stands up.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"She is an old friend of mine, and while we interact casually in private, she is my superior within the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our comrades gave the last full measure of their fealty as members of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In honor of their sacrifice, a moment of silence.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The captains of the ten squads and the other top brass of the Sworn Blades all fall silent.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"It would be one thing to fall on the battlefield, but these men died during the mere preparatory stages of our armed uprising.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Just imagining the regrets they must have pains my heart.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“At ease!”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Hotori stares resolutely forward.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The flames of vengeance burn bright within her refreshing eyes.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Many warriors have lost their lives since the beginning of this war.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thirty thousand in the air raids during the war, two thousand in combat, one thousand during the August Incident, and two hundred in reprisals thus far.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We must fight on to show that their deaths were not in vain.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We shall save Empress Hisui from the clutches of the treacherous Okonogi!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"All members present nod resolutely at Hotori's words.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The purpose of the Sworn Blades is to rescue Empress Hisui, who is now Okonogi's puppet.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"The Emperor rules the Empire in Oomikami's stead.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"For a mere retainer to manipulate that position is unforgivable.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"What, then, do we hope to achieve after rescuing Her Majesty?",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Our plan is to establish a provisional government in the countryside.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Empress Hisui will declare independence from the Republic and issue a nationwide call to arms.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"The words of the Empress herself will be transmitted across every last corner of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"The two hundred thousand members of the Imperial Police under Okonogi and the warriors who have yet to join the Sworn Blades will surely rise up in response.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"If liberation movements occur all throughout the country, even the Republic will have no choice but to sit down for negotiations.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Depending on how the battle goes, it may even be possible to win our independence outright.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"We believe this is the only plan capable of standing against the Republic's overwhelming forces of men and materiel.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Imperial Palace where Empress Hisui resides is heavily defended by Okonogi's Forbidden Guard.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The enemy numbers two thousand strong, outnumbering us tenfold.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But we are all surely aware that such a numerical difference is not insurmountable!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Armed with spellblades, we can easily strike down the Forbidden Guard.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As such, you are all to continue gathering them.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Spellblades are crystallizations of spellforce that priestesses offer their very lives to forge.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Only those born as warriors are capable of wielding them, and they do not so much as scratch even when cutting through the thickest of steel.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Furthermore, high-quality spellblades can confer a myriad of blessings, such as shrouding their edge in flames or frost, or enhancing the physical abilities of the wielder.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"It is due to the spellblades that warriors are said to have superhuman fighting strength.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"With a mere ordinary blade, facing five enemies at once is perhaps the extent of our abilities.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"Ideally, we want everyone to be equipped with a spellblade by the time of our uprising, but at present, there are only enough to arm half of our two hundred members.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The possession of spellblades was outlawed immediately after the war, and most of them were confiscated.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"It is said that of the approximately two thousand spellblades in existence prior to the war, nearly eighty percent are in the hands of the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This surely goes without saying, but when the time comes to rise up, your edge must be razor-sharp.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do not neglect your daily training.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course, you fellows do nothing but swing your blades from dawn to dusk anyways, so it's not as if you need reminding.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Laughter rises from among the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Republic's crackdowns are growing stricter by the day.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mind your own safety, but continue to gather spellblades and intelligence. Adjourned!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"All the members stand and face the altar at the head of the room.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"We bow once, grasp our wakizashi, and unsheathe a small portion of the blade.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"This is the Ringing, a ritual we unfailingly perform after every meeting.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“With Oomikami as our witness, we of the Sworn Blades solemnly affirm our steel-firm solidarity and pledge allegiance to Her Imperial Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any who would break this oath must by rights offer their life in atonement.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For allegiance.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For allegiance.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"We all release our blades at once, and the sound of guards striking sheaths echoes amidst the silence.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"The reverberation deep in my ears sets my soul aquiver.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I'm quite fond of the indescribable resonance of this sound.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The meeting is over, leaving only me and Hotori in the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Good work. My bad for always making you take the lead.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here, some tea.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“From the acting chairman herself? It's an honor indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Jeez, cut it out.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Hotori averts her eyes in embarrassment as I take the teacup from her.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"As always, I feel like the public-facing Hotori and the Hotori now alone with me are completely different people.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Hotori is fairly inarticulate by nature, and she always has a stern face whenever she talks with someone other than me.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"She's apparently always trying her hardest to decide on the right thing to say, but the person she's talking to never seems to understand that.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"As a result, most people's first impressions of her are that\nshe's disagreeable or intimidating.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Her bloodline, which bestows her headship of the warriors,\ndoesn't help her imposing image either.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Did I do a good job talking today?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. You're much more put-together than you give yourself credit for.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? You sure? I dunno...”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're just fine.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"When I pat her on the head, Hotori smiles happily.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Really?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you not know what 'fine' means?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I gently ruffle her hair.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aaaahaha! Sorry, sorry, sorry!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Hotori laughs happily as she squirms beneath my hand.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Hotori tenses up with a snap.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, just you two?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The man who just came in is the vice chairman of the Sworn Blades, Maki Kazuma.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hmm? What've we got 'ere?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Maki sniffs the air in the room.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, well, looks like I'm interruptin' your business with each other.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't be so crass. Remember, I'm the inspector general.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A better question, Maki, is why you're so late. The meeting ended a long time ago.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Yeah, sorry 'bout that. Had some business to take care of.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Not looking the least bit apologetic, Maki unfurls his favorite hand fan.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But ain't my problem if it's already over. Guess I'll hit the road.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't your lack of fealty the real problem?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Maki snaps his fan shut and taps my shoulder with it.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, now, Tokita, I don't think someone as forgetful as you gets to lecture me.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You forgot it all, didn'tcha? The hue of the flames that razed the Warrior District. The screams of our comrades. Even Her Majesty's face.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I don't wanna hear a damn word about fealty from the likes of you.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"It's just as Maki says. I have no memories from before the war.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"When I woke up, we'd already lost the war, and I'd completely forgotten not only my own name, but even the name of the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Supposedly the injuries I sustained during the war are to blame, but I don't know the finer details.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Thanks to Hotori taking care of me, I'm able to go about my life without any difficulties.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"But because of my lack of memories, I have only a vague sense of the humiliation and sorrow of our defeat.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I've lost precious family and friends, and yet all I feel is a faint and indistinct rage.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"In Kazuma's words, I'm just a “papier-mache” warrior.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Someone completely lacking a warrior's spirit.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My problems have nothing to do with yours. I'm speaking in the capacity of inspector general.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I ain't gonna stand for you looking down on me.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Least I haven't forgotten the deaths of my comrades.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You'd best believe I'll put my life on the line when the time comes. And I'd do it a damn sight better than you.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm talking about our rules here.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shut it, you papier-mache warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Hotori raises her voice as much as she can.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Maki pays her no mind and puts some strength into the fan on my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Losing my memory was most shameful of me. Blame me if you so desire.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I shrug off his fan.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Maki meets my defiance with a composed smirk.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Say, Tokita, how 'bout we work up a sweat for once?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well. Just don't forget that you started it.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What's it matter either way?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Kazuma's left hand slowly descends to his blade.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"But─",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Another blade is thrust between us.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"A silent protest from Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Maki slumps his shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Combat between fellow members is strictly forbidden.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Any further, and I'll reprimand you both.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oops.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"What kind of inspector general forgets the rules?",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maki, I will see you punished for your tardiness.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Effective immediately, you are ordered to perform maintenance on the spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oi, c'mon! You were ready to throw down just a second ago.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Inspector general's orders.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Fuckin' hell.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Kazuma slumps his shoulders again.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you have no objections, then get to it.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Good grief. Guess I've got nothin' on you, o mighty inspector general.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Waving his fan all the while, Maki leisurely saunters toward the arsenal.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a quiet breath.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks for intervening.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't give me that.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why'd you have to get so worked up? You know how Maki is. You shouldn't go at him head-on like that.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I was...”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Maki is a real troublemaker as far as warriors go, but I really don't mind his maverick personality.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"He's the vice chairman of the Sworn Blades, and more than a few of our young recruits idolize him.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry about your memories. You can take your time slowly getting them back.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maki isn't wrong. If anyone's made of papier-mache,\nit's...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't you dare blame yourself!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Hotori cuts me off.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Her gaze betrays genuine anger.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"She's always so kind.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"I know all too well that that look of hers contains feelings that go far beyond mere friendship, but I say nothing of it.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes linger on me for a long while before she finally relaxes her expression.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, you doing anything after this?”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm going to deliver my surviving relatives some get-well gifts.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"She says her relatives often curse her out whenever she visits them.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Considering her position, Hotori has no choice but to continue trying to apologize.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Verbal abuse or not, it must truly be hard to watch over her mourning relatives.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure have it rough.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, but I still have to do it.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. Can you send me some flowers later?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I jot down Hotori's order on the tablet computer I carry.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"I make my living at a flower shop now.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"The profession of “warrior” was abolished following the war, and so I lost my government salary.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"In this day and age, everyone has to earn their keep somehow.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And... done. I should be able to have it delivered by the end of the day.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks as always, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I part ways with Hotori and leave the Sworn Blades headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"The entrance is hidden in the basement of a general store.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"I go through the secret door, pass in front of the employee who doubles as a lookout, and finally emerge outside.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"The dusty outside air fills up my throat.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"In the morning, Yogarasu District is still bleary-eyed and drowsy.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"The shanty town of assorted shops is slowly making its preparations to open in the evening.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Their wares run the gamut from fenced goods to surplus purchased from the military, and even items salvaged from the wreckage of the air raids.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"I hop on a streetcar from Yogarasu District and make for Koujiya Flowers, my workplace and current residence.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"The Tenkyo cityscape moving past the windows looks as dismal as usual.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Here, Republican soldiers are making a show of force. There, Okonogi's Imperial Police are arresting innocents.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"The Imperial Police are a security force formed of the local population that Okonogi founded after the war.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"And yet, they crack down only on fellow Imperials, never so much as laying a finger on Republican citizens.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"This is daily life in Tenkyo; the streetcar's passengers all stifle their emotions as they gaze upon it.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"They are well aware that even a display of public outrage is an act that could easily cost them their lives.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Even I do nothing but silently observe this vicious abuse of power.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Until the time comes for the Sworn Blades to rise up, I\ncan't be causing unnecessary commotion.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've returned.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"I call out to the storefront, but there's no response.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Perhaps he's in the warehouse out back.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Manager. Manager!”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"The manager is buried head-deep in white chrysanthemums.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Manager of Koujiya Flowers, Inui Takahito.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Age: mid-thirties.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Pale, transparent skin.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Hair whose unrivaled softness draws the ire of women everywhere.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"The sharp, slit-like eyes that peek through his bangs are spine-chillingly captivating.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"His fragile, fleeting presence conjures up an image of an erudite literary scholar or a genius blademaster stricken with consumption.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"There are more than a few young damsels who frequent the store just to see him.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"That said, he is sickly in appearance only; save for his unfortunate liver, he is the spitting image of excellent health.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Incidentally, he is my employer, my landlord, and the benefactor who took me in after I was injured during the war.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Mm... nh... Soujin-kun?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't sleep in the chrysanthemums. You'll bring misfortune upon yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ah, but I just get so depressed whenever we get a lot of chrysanthemum orders.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I understand the feeling.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But even so, Hotori has ordered some more again.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, really? My condolences.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"The manager quietly closes his eyes and recites a prayer.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Once a priest, always a priest, it seems.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do we have any other deliveries?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Yes, if you would. Everything's already loaded up.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Roger that.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"I give the store's delivery list a once-over.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Most of our orders come from Republican expatriates or Republic-oriented restaurants.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"They're usually the flashy, ostentatious types of flowers, presumably for decorating lavish banquets.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Imperials can only imagine what that must be like nowadays.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Just by looking at our orders, one can get a vague sense of the state Tenkyo is in.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Cheer up, Soujin-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, but I'm fine. I'm all right.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Is that so? I hope I was just imagining things, then.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, I know. While we're at it, I'll let you take a peek at my nape that you love so much.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I don't particularly care for─”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Here, feeling better? You're feeling better, right?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Argh, give it a rest!”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"I pin down the manager's head as he tries to thrust his neck towards me.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Aghaghaghagh, easy on the sick guy!”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're the very picture of health, and we both know it.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Truth be told, I really am feeling a bit down.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades lost some good men, and then there was that incident with Maki about my memories.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"The manager always sees right through me.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, I almost forgot.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"The manager suddenly returns back to normal.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“We got a shipment of Persica blossoms today. First of the year.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, it is almost the season of Persica.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"I look at the calendar on the wall.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"In the Empire, we call this time in late March when peach flowers bloom “the season of Persica.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"It's a time of the year everyone looks forward to.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Apparently the winter in the south was a long one, and\nthat's why the shipment was late.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I noticed the buds on the peach trees around here were still hard, too.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hope they reach full bloom for the Persica Blossom Festival.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's only two weekends away. It's going to be close.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“A Persica Blossom Festival without peach flowers would be like sunny-side-up eggs without the sun.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Here, a little souvenir to celebrate our first shipment.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"He hands me a single Persica branch.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"The flowers are spread too wide, so they've lost their value as merchandise.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"I bring it to my face, and a sweet, refreshing aroma tickles my nostrils.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"It puts me in a curious mood, a heart-wrenching yet soothing medley of bittersweet feelings.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you. I'm quite fond of peaches.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I can tell from one look at your face.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wonder why. It's a mystery even to me.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"Persica blossoms are the national flower of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"They say that the first Empress, Himi-no-Mikoto, was especially enamored with them.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"Whether with cuisine or with landscapes, peaches and springtime are a reflexive association that all Imperials share in common.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Around this time, store shelves overflow with every manner of Persica-themed products, and all the popular songs feature fluttering peach blossoms in their lyrics.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Soujin-kun, Her Majesty's on.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"I check, and sure enough, Empress Hisui's visage is displayed on the television.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"It looks like they're broadcasting some sort of ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"It's still snowing, so it must be somewhere up north.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"She may be behind a screen, but I am still standing before Her Majesty.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"I straighten my posture and face the screen head-on.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In the previous war, the irreplaceable lives of many citizens were lost.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Three long years have since passed, yet even now, the scars of defeat run deep. It sincerely pains my heart to think of the hardships many people still endure.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I earnestly pray that we might bring our hearts together as one, so that all our peoples may live in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is also my fervent hope that the Imperial government might join hands with the people of the Republic, that we might expedite our Empire's recovery.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"Vigorous applause follows.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is the one and only child of Empress Suou, who took her own life as penance for our defeat.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Her presence has greatly soothed the hearts of many citizens hurt by the war.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Her unfadingly lovely figure has been likened to that of a daffodil, and she inspires widespread adoration.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Join hands with the people of the Republic, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her Majesty is only saying that because Okonogi made her.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am sure that her noble heart burns with resentment for the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Wouldn't that truly be nice.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“If Her Majesty sincerely recognized the Republic, I'd feel sorry for the warriors putting their lives on the line.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades number around two hundred strong.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"But no matter how exemplary our martial prowess might be, we stand no chance in a head-on confrontation with the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Even so, more than a few warriors yearn for precisely such a showdown.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"“If our battle is hopeless either way, let us be scattered in noble fashion.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"“Let us face the Republican Army as proud loyalists and meet an honorable end befitting a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"Such a ruinous aesthetic, seeking solace in perdition...",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I can't quite bring myself to sympathize with it.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"A true display of fealty to the Imperial Family would entail fighting for the Empire's restoration to the bitter end.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"Maki denounces me for “losing my pride along with my memories,” but even so, I don't think it's right to just give up hope on the Empire's restoration.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"A warrior's true purpose should go beyond merely dying a good death.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Step one is to rescue Her Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“With Okonogi out of the way, she will surely reveal her true feelings to us.”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm sure you're right. Let's stay strong and fight on.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'll support you however I can.”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"Despite being a civilian, the manager cooperates with the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"His knowledge of magicks makes him a reliable ally when someone is injured and needs a healer who doesn't ask questions.",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Anyway, I'm counting on you for those deliveries.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, about tonight. Is it all right if I take the long way home after I'm done?”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But of course. I'll close up myself, then.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you. I'll be going now.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"I take care of Hotori's order first, then get to the others one by one.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"The radio provides a steady flow of the usual bad news all the while.",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"“Imperial Police exposes group suspected of seditious activities.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"“Man arrested for attempted battery against Republican citizen.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"“Expansion of Republican Army facilities to maintain public safety.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Long story short, Okonogi is oppressing his people and brown-nosing the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"I cast my gaze outward in irritation.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"I can see Republican military uniforms here and there in the throngs visible from the car window.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Imperials typically keep their distance from Republicans to avoid trouble.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(No, it's not just Republicans. They avoid the warriors as well...)”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"My heart burns with disgrace when I recall the gazes Imperial citizens direct at us.",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Going on delivery with these feelings would be rude to the flowers.)”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"I pick up speed, trying to shake off this gloom in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			{
"I finish about half the deliveries and arrive at the hill overlooking the Imperial Tomb to take a break.",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"This place provides an unbroken view of all of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"It's a place I often visit when I have a spare moment between jobs.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"I pass by a mourner with a downturned expression and find a spot with a nice view.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"The first things my gaze falls upon are the Imperial Palace, surrounded by a wall of stone, and the destroyed edifice of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"The Barrier protected the Empire from outside invaders for two thousand years, but immediately after the war began, it was sundered without warning.",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"Its tragic silhouette is visible from everywhere in the city, serving as an omnipresent symbol of our defeat.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			{
"All the land within a two-kilometer radius of the Imperial Palace is now under Republican occupation, and entry requires a Republic-issued visa.",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			{
"This zone contains the Republic Government-General, among other Republic facilities, along with a garrison of around 20,000 soldiers to provide security.",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"Put another way, the Imperial Palace is constantly surrounded by overwhelming military force.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"Her Majesty's residence is surrounded by invaders with their guns pointed inwards─",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"A sight that symbolizes the meaning of “defeat” in every sense of the word.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Once revered as stalwart guardians of the people, the warriors are now treated like war criminals for our role in the Empire's defeat.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"The scornful gazes the people direct at the warriors are not unlike those given to a stray dog rummaging for scraps.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"Because Empress Suou met a noble and fitting end, the vitriol that we face is particularly harsh.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			{
"─We lost only because the warriors were indolent and lazy.",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"─If the warriors hadn't been defeated, we wouldn't be suffering such hardship.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			{
"─Her Majesty took responsibility with her own life; the warriors should all do the same.",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"I have no intention of rebuking such sentiments.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"The only way for us to reclaim our honor is to take back the Empire from the clutches of the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"Now, more than ever, is the time to fight with all my body and soul.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"I know this, and yet I lack the same fervent zeal that Hotori and all the other Sworn Blades possess.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"It looks like snow might start falling from the dark gray sky at any moment.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"The thick snow clouds look like a steel canopy enveloping the world.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"So heavy...",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			{
"My body and soul are both so heavy, as though bound by invisible chains.",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"I want to break free.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"I want to tear these chains to pieces and rampage headlong across the battlefield, all for the sake of my lord.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"And I want to throw off the heavy, oppressive canopy that covers this world in its shadow.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"...Is this not the most cherished desire of any man born a warrior?",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“──!!!”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"I face Tenkyo and scream out at the top of my lungs.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"But were it so simple to unbind myself from these chains, I would have broken free long ago.",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"─Did you hear that?",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			{
"─Indeed, I did.",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"─It's the pathetic howling of a dog who's lost his master.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"Just past nine of the clock at night, I finish the final delivery.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"That's the last of my work for the flower shop.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			{
"I'll use the rest of my time for the sake of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			{
"Four days ago, we received intel that the Republican Army would be transporting several of the spellblades it confiscated.",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades need to retrieve them by any means necessary.",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"As a result of our spy Koyuzu's efforts, we've managed to somewhat narrow down the likely transport routes.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"Tonight, I plan to reconnoiter these routes myself.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			{
"I continue my investigation for a while and enter an area full of businesses and high-end establishments.",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			{
"Due to the snow, the streets are largely silent, with few passersby.",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"There is no oncoming traffic, but there is a four-car motorcade in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			{
"They're all the same jet-black model of luxury cars.",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			{
"Perhaps they're carrying some VIP.",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"The light in front of us turns red.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			{
"The black cars slow down one by one, and behind them, I also step on the brakes.",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"In that instant, a shiver runs through my body.",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
"Standing atop the gleaming red traffic light, a single girl is perched.",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"Shaded by the dead of night, her ceremonial dress flutters in the chill breeze as snow drifts down around her regal silhouette.",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"As though by a miracle of creation, a breathtaking grace and a clearness that threatens to scour all impurities are united as one within her.",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Hear me, treacherous Okonogi Tokihiko.”",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"A crisp voice.",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"Her voice should never have reached me, but my ears still clearly capture the sound of her lips.",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“For the crimes of slaying your lord, and giving aid and comfort to our enemies, you shall find atonement in death!”",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"A red spark runs up her blade and bursts at the tip.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			{
"Her lithe form is sucked into empty air─",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			{
"The girl's strike cleaves the lead car in two.",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			{
"The next moment, she leaps high, riding the shockwave of the explosion.",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"She lands gently on the awning of a nearby high-rise.",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			{
"Clutched in her hand is a spellblade emitting a pale light.",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(A spellblade... Could she be a warrior?)”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			{
"I grab my sidearm and exit the van.",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"At the same time, Imperial guards pour out from the cars behind the destroyed one.",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“Protect Her Majesty with your lives!”",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her Majesty?!”",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			{
"Is Empress Hisui in one of those cars?!",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			{
"The burnt-out vehicle is blocking the road, so Her\nMajesty's car can't move right away.",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			{
"As I digest the gravity of the situation, the girl leaps into the air once more.",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			{
"When she lands, her baleful blade will surely rend all the remaining cars asunder.",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			{
"─I must protect Her Majesty!",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			{
"I throw my blade's sheath at where the girl is falling and sprint with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			{
"The girl shifts her trajectory in response to the unexpected projectile.",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			{
"That is when I strike.",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			{
"I clash blades with her head-on and fling her away with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Get those cars moving!”",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's car cuts into the opposite lane and speeds into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			{
"The girl is unable to pursue.",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			{
"She has to be wary of my follow-up attack.",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Crap!”",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			{
"Suddenly, gunfire lights up our surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"A hail of bullets rains down upon the distracted girl.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			{
"Twelve shots─",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			{
"The cold steel rips into her slender body.",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			{
"Even so, the girl doesn't stop moving.",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			{
"She leaps to the side and uses the momentum to run up the wall of a building.",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(You're not going anywhere!)”",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			{
"She made an attempt on Her Majesty's life. I won't allow her to escape.",
			},
		},
		[434]={
			{
"As I leap into the sky, I find my mark on a roof two buildings ahead.",
			},
		},
		[435]={
			{
"The girl is clutching her side as she bounds across the high-rise rooftops as though they were stepping stones.",
			},
		},
		[436]={
			{
"Moving through the air is an effective way of shaking pursuers in a city.",
			},
		},
		[437]={
			{
"That is, unless the one giving chase is a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[438]={
			{
"When the girl leaps down from a roof, I close the distance in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[439]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ghh...”",
			},
		},
		[440]={
			{
"The girl doubles over as soon as she lands.",
			},
		},
		[441]={
			{
"Even so, she manages to stay standing, supporting her weight with her blade.",
			},
		},
		[442]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Haah, haah...! Keep it together...”",
			},
		},
		[443]={
			{
"With ragged breaths, she takes one step forward, then another.",
			},
		},
		[444]={
			{
"I descend from the rooftops and land right behind her.",
			},
		},
		[445]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Halt.”",
			},
		},
		[446]={
			{
"She turns around.",
			},
		},
		[447]={
			{
"Even in the darkness, I see her expression as clear as day.",
			},
		},
		[448]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[449]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wh...”",
			},
		},
		[450]={
			{
"The moment our eyes meet, the sound of our surroundings ceases to exist.",
			},
		},
		[451]={
			{
"I can't take my eyes off of her.",
			},
		},
		[452]={
			{
"Her amaranthine eyes are divine springs that shimmer with each ripple.",
			},
		},
		[453]={
			{
"Her appearance is elegant yet sensual, at once seemingly thoughtful yet unmistakably exuding the aura of one governed by intense passions.",
			},
		},
		[454]={
			{
"She is all manner of expression, sublimed into a single, perfect gemstone.",
			},
		},
		[455]={
			{
"I see this girl's phantasm in a vision that lasts but a split second.",
			},
		},
		[456]={
			{
"Have I met her somewhere before?",
			},
		},
		[457]={
			{
"I remember not.",
			},
		},
		[458]={
			{
"But my body tells me otherwise.",
			},
		},
		[459]={
			{
"Deep within my chest, my heart is hammering a furious beat.",
			},
		},
		[460]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[461]={
			{
"The girl, too, fixes her gaze at me, forgetting even to blink.",
			},
		},
		[462]={
			{
"Untold emotions swirl within the depths of her limpid eyes.",
			},
		},
		[463]={
			{
"At last, they turn into words that blossom forth from her efflorescent lips of Persica.",
			},
		},
		[464]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“How strange. To think that you of all people would stand in my way...”",
			},
		},
		[465]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you know me?”",
			},
		},
		[466]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“How could I ever forget?”",
			},
		},
		[467]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When was this? Where did we meet?”",
			},
		},
		[468]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Hehee. So you don't remember?”",
			},
		},
		[469]={
			{
"The girl breaks her gaze for the first time, looking downwards.",
			},
		},
		[470]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Insensitive brute...”",
			},
		},
		[471]={
			{
"The girl mutters to herself before raising her head once more.",
			},
		},
		[472]={
			{
"She readies her blade with clear hostility.",
			},
		},
		[473]={
			{
"Her form is flawless, without any clear openings.",
			},
		},
		[474]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When did we meet!?”",
			},
		},
		[475]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“That's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[476]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tell me.”",
			},
		},
		[477]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[478]={
			{
"I lean back slightly to evade her beautiful diagonal slash.",
			},
		},
		[479]={
			{
"She steps in further and thrusts at my neck.",
			},
		},
		[480]={
			{
"The girl's bladework is orthodox and well practiced, but she has not achieved mastery, making her moves easy to see through.",
			},
		},
		[481]={
			{
"I twist my body to avoid the tip of her blade, and her defenseless flank appears right before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[482]={
			{
"Cutting her down would be all too easy...",
			},
		},
		[483]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[484]={
			{
"The girl panics and takes her distance.",
			},
		},
		[485]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“What, are you showing mercy on me?”",
			},
		},
		[486]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First, I want you to tell me about myself.”",
			},
		},
		[487]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Lay off!”",
			},
		},
		[488]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ugh?!”",
			},
		},
		[489]={
			{
"The girl tries to close in again, but her leg collapses out from under her.",
			},
		},
		[490]={
			{
"Blood seeps out from under her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[491]={
			{
"As it spreads across the white fabric, it resembles a camellia fallen onto fresh snow.",
			},
		},
		[492]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“I heard voices! Over there!”",
			},
		},
		[493]={
			{
"The voices of the guards cut through the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[494]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I can't let this be the end of me...”",
			},
		},
		[495]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Okonogi... I still haven't...”",
			},
		},
		[496]={
			{
"The girl tries to stand up, but her legs refuse to comply.",
			},
		},
		[497]={
			{
"She's approaching her limit.",
			},
		},
		[498]={
			{
"Once the guards arrive, we'll no longer be able to talk freely.",
			},
		},
		[499]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ask you again. When did the two of us meet?”",
			},
		},
		[500]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“If you save me, I'll tell you everything.”",
			},
		},
		[501]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That won't be possible.”",
			},
		},
		[502]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I refuse to turn a blind eye to one who made an attempt on Her Majesty's life.”",
			},
		},
		[503]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“...I thought you'd say that.”",
			},
		},
		[504]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“You haven't changed one bit.”",
			},
		},
		[505]={
			{
"For some reason, the girl smiles a faint smile to herself.",
			},
		},
		[506]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“Over here!”",
			},
		},
		[507]={
			{
"I hear a voice from behind.",
			},
		},
		[508]={
			{
"We're out of time.",
			},
		},
		[509]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I suggest you surrender.”",
			},
		},
		[510]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I'll not abide such disgrace.”",
			},
		},
		[511]={
			{
"The girl thrusts her blade hard into the ground and somehow manages to come to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[512]={
			{
"Staggering all the while, she points its tip directly at me.",
			},
		},
		[513]={
			{
"Fresh flowers of crimson blossom all across her pale skin.",
			},
		},
		[514]={
			{
"Even nigh unto death, how fair and beautiful her expression truly is.",
			},
		},
		[515]={
			{
"In deference to her resolve, I steady my own blade.",
			},
		},
		[516]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin. Warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[517]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Tokita... Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[518]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I finally learned your name.”",
			},
		},
		[519]={
			{
"The girl smiles.",
			},
		},
		[520]={
			{
"A smile like a peach flower in full blossom, wholly unfit for someone on the very precipice of life.",
			},
		},
		[521]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“My name is Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[522]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Daughter of Empress Suou, Crown Princess of the Empire, and the sole legitimate successor to the Imperial Throne.”",
			},
		},
		[523]={
			{
"─The princess?",
			},
		},
		[524]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You speak nonsense.”",
			},
		},
		[525]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you can wield a spellblade, the blood of a warrior runs through your veins. You cannot possibly be of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[526]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've always been able to activate spellblades. No idea why, though.”",
			},
		},
		[527]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Silence! I've heard enough.”",
			},
		},
		[528]={
			{
"The girl calling herself Miyaguni purses her lips.",
			},
		},
		[529]={
			{
"A single peach petal, drifting in from places unknown, grazes against the tip of Miyaguni's blade as it flutters down to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[530]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Have at you then. My head should make a fine offering for Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[531]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[532]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I won't come back and haunt you.”",
			},
		},
		[533]={
			{
"Miyaguni smiles faintly, as if she's just told her best joke.",
			},
		},
		[534]={
			{
"At the sight of that unwavering smile, my body suddenly stiffens.",
			},
		},
		[535]={
			{
"It's as though every fiber of my being is resisting my will to strike her down.",
			},
		},
		[536]={
			{
"What... is this?",
			},
		},
		[537]={
			{
"Once again, a vision flashes through my mind.",
			},
		},
		[538]={
			{
"Amaranthine eyes.",
			},
		},
		[539]={
			{
"Efflorescent Persica lips.",
			},
		},
		[540]={
			{
"I... I know this girl.",
			},
		},
		[541]={
			{
"─Don't kill her.",
			},
		},
		[542]={
			{
"I hear a whisper in the back of my ears.",
			},
		},
		[543]={
			{
"─Don't kill her.",
			},
		},
		[544]={
			{
"─Protect this girl.",
			},
		},
		[545]={
			{
"The whisper turns into a deafening voice that thrums through my whole body.",
			},
		},
		[546]={
			{
"It's the voice of my instincts.",
			},
		},
		[547]={
			{
"A voice of absolute authority given shape by the very depths of my essence.",
			},
		},
		[548]={
			{
"─Don't kill her.",
			},
		},
		[549]={
			{
"─Protect this girl.",
			},
		},
		[550]={
			{
"─",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That is your purpose.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[551]={
			{
"The raging fires of my instincts scorch away my reason in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[552]={
			{
"My body is compelled by a force I've never felt before.",
			},
		},
		[553]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“There they are!”",
			},
		},
		[554]={
			{
"The enemy is twenty meters away. They number seven.",
			},
		},
		[555]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm borrowing this.”",
			},
		},
		[556]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[557]={
			{
"I snatch Miyaguni's blade from her.",
			},
		},
		[558]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“That woman is an attempted assassin. Stand down at once.”",
			},
		},
		[559]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“If you don't comply, you'll be deemed an accomplice.”",
			},
		},
		[560]={
			{
"A row of rifle muzzles glares at me.",
			},
		},
		[561]={
			{
"My answer is obvious.",
			},
		},
		[562]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I refuse.”",
			},
		},
		[563]={
			{
"A salvo of supersonic bullets spews forth, racing straight for my heart.",
			},
		},
		[564]={
			{
"If they strike true, even a warrior will not come out unscathed.",
			},
		},
		[565]={
			{
"But─",
			},
		},
		[566]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“Haagh, a warrior?!”",
			},
		},
		[567]={
			name={"name", name="Skinny Guard"},
			{
"“Hey! Don't hold anything back!”",
			},
		},
		[568]={
			{
"In the next moment, hundreds of bullets close in to tear us to shreds.",
			},
		},
		[569]={
			{
"Evading them would be simple enough if I were alone.",
			},
		},
		[570]={
			{
"But if I move, Miyaguni will die.",
			},
		},
		[571]={
			{
"Then what do I do?",
			},
		},
		[572]={
			{
"What do I do?",
			},
		},
		[573]={
			{
"If I can't dodge, then my only option is to repel them.",
			},
		},
		[574]={
			{
"With but a single swing of my blade.",
			},
		},
		[575]={
			{
"...Can I do it?",
			},
		},
		[576]={
			{
"Doubt flickers through my mind.",
			},
		},
		[577]={
			{
"No, this isn't a matter of “can” or “can't” do.",
			},
		},
		[578]={
			{
"I must.",
			},
		},
		[579]={
			{
"Put everything on the line to protect her.",
			},
		},
		[580]={
			{
"Protect that which is most precious to me until the very end!",
			},
		},
		[581]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aaaaaaaaaahhhhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[582]={
			{
"The edge of my blade breaks the sound barrier.",
			},
		},
		[583]={
			{
"The rumbling vibrations pierce through the earth, shattering the surrounding glass like icicles.",
			},
		},
		[584]={
			{
"A thick cloud of dust envelops the guards and steals away their line of sight.",
			},
		},
		[585]={
			{
"Not a single one of their countless bullets reaches us.",
			},
		},
		[586]={
			{
"Did I do it?",
			},
		},
		[587]={
			{
"It doesn't feel like I did.",
			},
		},
		[588]={
			{
"But the lingering numbness in my right hand is proof enough.",
			},
		},
		[589]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go!”",
			},
		},
		[590]={
			{
"I pull Miyaguni in by the arm.",
			},
		},
		[591]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaawwahh?!”",
			},
		},
		[592]={
			{
"I leap towards the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[593]={
			{
"I alight on a rooftop with a single bound and leap again without delay.",
			},
		},
		[594]={
			{
"The Tenkyo nightscape streams past my eyes at high speeds.",
			},
		},
		[595]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't fall.”",
			},
		},
		[596]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[597]={
			{
"Miyaguni clings to me tightly.",
			},
		},
		[598]={
			{
"My attention drifts to the touch of her warm body nestled against me and the softness of her hair caressing my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[599]={
			{
"─How beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[600]={
			{
"The first thought that comes to mind is a simple, idiotic one.",
			},
		},
		[601]={
			{
"Her porcelain white skin. Her efflorescent Persica lips.",
			},
		},
		[602]={
			{
"The swell of her ample chest makes its softness known even through our clothes.",
			},
		},
		[603]={
			{
"Her lusciously gleaming thighs, laid bare by the strong winds, are so captivating that I can't help but find my gaze drawn to them.",
			},
		},
		[604]={
			{
"Within her is both the firmness of an adolescent girl and the softness of a mature woman, her body concealing a sublime divinity, as a bud about to blossom.",
			},
		},
		[605]={
			{
"I feel my temperature rising just from holding her.",
			},
		},
		[606]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh!”",
			},
		},
		[607]={
			{
"Miyaguni jolts at every sudden impact of landing.",
			},
		},
		[608]={
			{
"Her wounds are not light.",
			},
		},
		[609]={
			{
"Her life is in danger if she doesn't get treatment soon.",
			},
		},
		[610]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I'll save you. I swear it.)”",
			},
		},
		[611]={
			{
"This unfamiliar girl named Miyaguni Akari.",
			},
		},
		[612]={
			{
"This preposterous, reprehensible girl who not only claims to be of the Imperial Family, but even attacked Her Majesty.",
			},
		},
		[613]={
			{
"This girl who, if I truly live for fealty, I should never have saved.",
			},
		},
		[614]={
			{
"In this very moment, I am turning my back on the fealty I swore to Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[615]={
			{
"And yet my heart burns bright red with an excitement the likes of which I've never felt before.",
			},
		},
		[616]={
			{
"It's as though the hollow in my chest that's been there ever since I lost my memories is now being kindled from within.",
			},
		},
		[617]={
			{
"So light...",
			},
		},
		[618]={
			{
"My body and soul are as light as if I've grown wings.",
			},
		},
		[619]={
			{
"In this very moment, the chains binding my body are nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[620]={
			{
"This is my true self.",
			},
		},
		[621]={
			{
"─She is what I've been searching for all this time.",
			},
		},
		[622]={
			{
"All the tiresome logic in the world could not refute this feeling I feel deep in my very bones.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
